                                                                100% Escrow Secured
                                                            </span>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <span class="text-muted small d-block" style="font-size: 0.80rem; line-height: 1.35; margin-top: 2px;">Customer has paid via Razorpay. Money is secured in Escrow and will be credited to you upon handover.</span>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
